post.description:
Realtime JSON ingest for SIEM / rsyslog / custom forwarders.

Auth: header `X-Ingest-Key: <INGEST_API_KEY>` or `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`.

Body examples:
  {"text": "raw log lines...\n", "source": "rsyslog"}
  {"lines": ["line1", "line2"], "filename": "firewall.log"}

